    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="c2252bba-010e-5ed8-b7eb-060162b08b62" activityNameId="72989dd5-8611-5c87-b2d4-f56636e24d87" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Grass from natural meadow intensive organic, at field</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Grass from natural meadow intensive organic, at field
Refers to 1 kg dry matter of fresh gras from intensive organic production with 1.66 kg CO2  and 17.9 MJ per kg dry matter. The dry matter content of fresh gras is about 10-15%;
UUID: 5da50fb9-c77e-36df-895b-946415940050
The inventories include the cultivation of gras on a permanent meadow. Included steps are fertilisation (cattle slurry and manure), harvest, loading for transport.
Location: Refers to a production in the Swiss plateau (lowlands &lt;700m).
Technology: Intensive organic production.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data were compiled from statistics, fertilising recommendations, documents from extension services and expert knowledge. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5da50fb9-c77e-36df-895b-946415940050.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
